        },
        "quote": "(a) Operations. Each applicant shall at the time of registration and by December 1st of each year thereafter file a construction and major maintenance plan for projects in the public right-of-way with the Director. Such plan shall be submitted using a GIS or comparable form designated by the Director.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.070:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.30.070 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "c05b6ee2-f883-57e5-8f70-c4e052da9bf0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 376,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.070:block:1",
          "start": 303
        },
        "quote": "The plan shall include, but not be limited to, the following information:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.070:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.30.070 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "045e310c-17df-5d8d-8830-c30d0aab6826",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 524,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.070:block:2",
          "start": 377
        },
        "quote": "(1) The locations and the estimated beginning and ending dates of all currently planned projects to be commenced during the next calendar year; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.070:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.30.070 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "3fabd97c-8fdc-57f3-adfc-cf60ef5193d5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 698,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.070:block:3",
          "start": 525
        },
        "quote": "(2) The tentative locations and estimated beginning and ending dates for all currently planned projects contemplated for the five years following the next calendar year; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.070:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.30.070 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "eb2458c3-ba3d-5a11-94de-3309575df17f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 859,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.070:block:4",
          "start": 699
        },
        "quote": "(3) Any information deemed necessary by the Director to facilitate coordination and reduction of the number of excavations and obstructions in the right-of-way.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.070:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.30.070 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "1f990a16-327d-53bf-8126-f88a5b1ac561",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 956,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.070:block:5",
          "start": 860
        },
        "quote": "The term “project” in this section shall include both next-year projects and five-year projects.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.070:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.30.070 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "23c63ac6-3dab-56e3-ae55-d868314f98f3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1260,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.070:block:6",
          "start": 957
        },
        "quote": "By January 1st of each year the Director will have available for inspection in the Director’s office a composite list of all projects of which the Director has been informed in the annual plans. All registrants are responsible for keeping themselves informed of the current status of the composite list.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.070:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.30.070 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "dd391f2a-fe04-50e3-b77e-4840d9efb9cb",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1708,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.070:block:7",
          "start": 1261
        },
        "quote": "Thereafter, but preferably by March 1st, each registrant may change any project in its list of next-year major projects, and must notify the Director and all other registrants of any changes to include schedule changes in said major projects annual plan. Notwithstanding the foregoing, a registrant may at any time join in a next-year project of another registrant listed by the other registrant. (Ord. 17587 § 5-3, 10-24-00. Code 1995 § 130-678.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.070:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.30.070 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "b770d466-09b4-593a-9a1c-7ad859a7594f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
